    "instant_z_h_ay_atp_fvnl7a6_ss_G43wXJ": {
      "type": "instant-zHAyAtpFvnl7a6SS",
      "settings": {
        "text_FId9aQ8LoYnMc9CX": "<h3>ALL DELICIOUS</h3>",
        "text_K3IPhfeUmPHR6os4": "<h3>FLAVOURs</h3>",
        "text_q0OovOvlZaEVt3kN": "<h3>you need</h3>",
        "text_CRwKFDU8jmrNkIlz": "<h3>MONEY BACK</h3>",
        "text_WBQcaAakVrWbslG8": "<h3>GUARANTEE</h3>",
        "text_17aVzgm46l2kTrjB": "<h3>We’re so confident in Lio, that if it didn&apos;t work,  </h3><h3>you’ll get your money back.</h3>",
        "text_9voC8MfaLYCwGWNT": "<h3>Less than 1% claim their money back </h3>",
        "product_ick0L9Q1HTFzpo42": "lio®-journey-pack",
        "text_taMHouX99Al5Ejq4": "<h3>THE ONLY</h3>",
        "text_1l1bFy30Sc48w8HG": "<h3><strong>ALTERNATIVE</strong></h3>",
        "text_QFlSEeHL5mSx9pag": "<h3><strong>\"Why is quitting so hard?\"</strong></h3>",
        "text_3o3Z7EFASA4zjpq5": "<p><strong>Because most quitting methods rely on nicotine, keeping you stuck in the cycle of addiction. </strong></p><p></p><p>Lio, is different—no nicotine, no chemicals, just natural flavoured air that curbs cravings while keeping the familiar hand-to-mouth motion.</p>",
        "text_sJ3uFfH9IeAfkJHq": "<h3>World&apos;s first</h3>",
        "text_B0bekbyolWAc2aHR": "<h3>Flavoured</h3>",
        "text_cMKLPX7KcfzWpKDl": "<h3><strong>AIR DIFFUSER</strong></h3>",
        "text_HwXvBwZeAEPJ20pX": "<h3>World&apos;s first</h3>",
        "text_TUKLYQgcpDxsTmqA": "<h3>FLAVOURED</h3>",
        "text_GYBGPNOWEGFpEWGj": "<h3>AIR DIFFUSER</h3>",
        "text_ySbOKxchWp0xBRwh": "<h3>\"The diffuser that’s transforming the way people quit smoking &amp; vaping for good.\"</h3>",
        "text_fndkDmtYI7SYB7le": "<p>Quitting smoking or vaping isn’t easy, but Lio simplifies it by focusing on what truly works.</p><p></p><p>Unlike other solutions that rely on nicotine or chemicals, Lio helps you <strong>curb cravings naturally</strong> while preserving the familiar<strong> hand-to-mouth habit</strong>.</p><p></p><p>No need for cold turkey or frustration with methods that fall short.</p><p></p><p>With Lio, you get a <strong>natural</strong>, <strong>stress-free way</strong> to break free—without side effects.</p><p></p><p>It’s a tool designed to support your journey, making quitting feel achievable and empowering every step of the way.</p>",
        "text_1tTgxMEEPKTq07jB": "<p>Start My Journey</p>",
        "url_NwIDJBLhypho2nL8": "#i7ruGs3H0LLIY53mK",
        "text_AB9O9d1tYWmIYell": "<p>Start My Journey</p>",
        "text_aIIWMMcYJa0Znrrj": "<p>Didn&apos;t quit in 30 Days? Money Back!</p>",
        "text_XmFM1sAMOKsSFscQ": "<p>Rated 4.7/5 out of 400+ reviews</p>",
        "text_ZAbDwRUOlJoRbiYZ": "<h3>what our customers say</h3>",
        "text_O1KvkfZNtECFE9Y6": "<p>Discover the incredible </p><p>success stories our customers.</p>",
        "text_Wkv7bJK4zqUyVala": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_y4Po3H4Aw8zqKkfO": "<p>Simple &amp; Effective</p>",
        "text_sHfLsDkB9bZRY9vt": "<p>\"After a week of using Lio, I already feel the difference. No smoke, no nicotine—just something to keep my hands busy guilt-free. A true lifesaver!\"</p>",
        "text_6cuFsa8bGnApogiG": "<p>Zakaria Ernst</p><p>(9 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_Nt5zXOQijW5moYCi": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_9uhwWWGzx9P7bTyD": "<p>Helps me stay off cigs!</p>",
        "text_dgqskPMsuT3ZQPz7": "<p>\"Lio has been an excellent replacement to curb my cravings. Lost my device, but they quickly sent a replacement—great product and service!\"</p>",
        "text_hTae24fd1HCrUcuL": "<p>Josje Laan</p><p>(18 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_Zn4zcPTKuyeYsG3u": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_Tswlw00IhhtvvZJb": "<p>Absolute game-changer!</p>",
        "text_EWAwMd6LhCmaG4CH": "<p>\"3 months nicotine-free thanks to Lio! The customer service was exceptional. I&apos;m grateful for this product on my journey to quit smoking💪\"</p>",
        "text_Z6ugpuv9nna6nlbH": "<p>Sofie Povis</p><p>(5 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_BthNYz1JjmK1hYOl": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_rRB5KgDB7bDMrbuA": "<p>I quit after 35 years</p>",
        "text_ROU1d2KEiuPpXZbs": "<p>\"After seeing my colleague with his Lio, I took the plunge. I had been a smoker for 35 years and quitting was hell. With Lio it goes without saying, although I don&apos;t leave my house without it.\"</p>",
        "text_MDhN5LIV4vn3czO6": "<p>Koen Bakker</p><p>(16 Days Ago)</p>",
        "text_aKeTVk3C3TnuDaKh": "<p>Verified Buyer </p>",
        "text_sODzkRXnkXWFq6Q6": "<p>Lio saved my life</p>",
        "text_rbUXjcGK7liDbvK9": "<p>I was smoking almost 20 cigarettes per day. I tried lots of expensive ways to quit smoking but unfortunately without results. I decided to try Lio and in 2 weeks I&apos;m only using this. Without anxiety crisis.</p>",
        "text_p3nCEpzNsuKA3lMU": "<p>Pedro Kawal</p><p>(18 Days Ago)</p>",
        "url_eq6hMM4xuOsZdW9A": "#i7ruGs3H0LLIY53mK",
        "text_SJXUTIhYRFMSMM5v": "<p>Start My Journey</p>",
        "text_rKd1akfB4mWMNBKL": "<h3>THE LIO DIFFUSER</h3>",
        "text_fO0Ii1BFAvcqI18v": "<h3>EXPLAINED</h3>",
        "text_WOk0IL9ejrxEXObb": "<h3><strong>\"Using Lio is as simple as it gets—designed for ease and effectiveness.\"</strong></h3>",
        "text_BKcwaEKEfNx3BPRv": "<h3>Not complicated—just 3 simple steps:</h3>",
        "text_yCD7cNT23PGY9Gbt": "<h3>Not complicated—just 3 simple steps:</h3>",
        "text_zfnO39gDWAq8Ovxa": "<h3><strong>1:</strong> Fray </h3><h3>the Core</h3>",
        "text_gPjpJ0kkIrJ0a3pS": "<h3><strong>3:</strong> Relief</h3><h3>cravings</h3>",
        "text_H8o8VBCjGCK6nNCR": "<h3><strong>2:</strong> Insert</h3><h3>the Core</h3>",
        "url_yQOSNkONzbgFNT6n": "#i7ruGs3H0LLIY53mK",
        "text_feUMBawQoVlgNou5": "<p>Start My Journey</p>",
        "text_Irjs7cqw8yIjhTAU": "<p>Rated 4.7/5 out of 400+ reviews</p>",
        "text_iPGUTbwOwo4hK9Y9": "<h3>Real stories from </h3><h3>people like you.</h3>",
        "text_Q9CTo1FDBwbhwjaX": "<p>Our customers say..</p>",
        "text_4W5QnalED0BMyeo9": "<p>Great Taste</p>",
        "text_fHe1TWQSWpTbD1JH": "<p>Replaced Hand to Mouth Habit</p>",
        "text_nTA4CsWSeeZbLUp5": "<p>No Nicotine Intake</p>",
        "text_wusbnD2wCMaNQOv2": "<p>Most Effective Alternative</p>",
